touch — create an empty file
============================

Creates an empty regular file at the given path.

    module oskit.bin.touch

    import oskit.ulib.{puts, exit, get_args, skip_arg0, create}

    main()
        val path = skip_arg0(get_args())
        if len(path) == 0
            puts("usage: touch <file>\n")
            exit()
            return
        val result = create(path, 1, 0x1FF)
        if result < 0
            puts("error\n")
        exit()
